<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson wins Russia paging system order.</title>
<headline>Ericsson wins Russia paging system order.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecoms firm LM Ericsson AB said on Tuesday it had won an order from NTC FAPSI for the supply and installation of a paging system in Russia.</p>
<p>No value for the deal was given.</p>
